A `--set` argument with no `=` is user error: nothing renders and the message names the offending
pair.

-- fixtures/cwd/probe.md.j2 --
threshold {{ config.core.sprint.default_threshold_sp }}
-- cmd --
booping render /proc/self/cwd/probe.md.j2 --set nope
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: malformed --set pair (expected KEY=VALUE): nope
